{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、 おはようございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-です //"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日は 名古屋にて個別握手会がありました..*\n今回の私服は こんな感じです //"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ白の ハイウエストデニム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして上が ピンクとオレンジの間の様な色で美味しそうなんです..*てへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして よく履くピンヒールね //\n後は、アクセサリーだね..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプルな所に キラッと光る物を付けるのが好きだから、毎回 その私服に合わせてピアスとか変えてるんだよ〜*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、Rotty夢"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以外の方から、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いつも自分の推しのblogしか見ないけど、ろってぃーのblogだけは握手会の後 見させてもらってるよ〜!!! 」\nだとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ろってぃーって私服のセンスいいよ〜..* だから毎回 参考にさせてもらってるの〜*^^* 」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だとか言ってくれる方がたくさん居て、\n本当に嬉しいです \\´` /"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話かわりますが、\n昨日は まる１日 ある撮影をしてきました !!\nいいものになりますように..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日はこれから ラジオ収録です..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし。ろってぃ-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( のし←ばいばいってとですよん..*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイバイを表す顔文字って\n(^o^)ノシ ←こうゆう手を振る感じの表現やったりするぢゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノシの部分を平仮名にして いつも「のし。ろってぃ-より」って書いてるんだぁよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たま〜に「のし」って何〜？って\n聞かれることがあるの説明しときました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/21/3471163/0007.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}